lth care, health & wellness coaching, legal services, financial counselling, and more Health & Wellness In the Health & Wellness section, learn about Medical, Dental, Pharmacy, Vision, FSAs, HSAs, and additional Premera programs TouchCare Wellness Program Benefit Enhancement Program - Powered by Corestream Joint Health Care Committee (JHCC) Learn more Retirement & Financial Security In the Retirement & Financial Security section, learn about PERS, ORP, and the UA Pension Plan Voluntary tax-deferred annuity (TDA) or Roth 403(b) 457 (b) / Deferred Compensation (executives only) Social Security and Medicare Insurances (Basic, Supplemental, and AD&D) Benefit Enhancement Program - Powered by Corestream Learn more Holidays & Leave In the Holidays & Leave section, learn about Holidays Annual Leave Sick Leave Family Medical Leave (FML) Parental Leave Short-term Disability (STD) Long-term Disability Additional Leaves Learn more Employee Support In the Employee Support section, learn about TouchCare Employee Assistance Program (EAP) Talkspace LifeWorks Benefit Enhancement Program - Powered by Corestream Benefit News Scheduling time with Benefits Learn more Education Benefits In the Education Benefits section, learn about Tuition Waiver Alaska 529 Plan Sabbatical Leave Learn more Classification & Compensation In the Classification & Compensation section, learn about Compensation Position Classification & Job Families Educational Attainment Incentive Program Learn more Growth and Development University of Alaska employees are provided incentives and multiple modalities in which they can take control of their education, career and development, and personal growth through continuing education resources and opportunities, tuition waivers, and fun and engaging health & wellness programs. Check out UA's ever-expanding Employee Engagement & Development Center for more information. Employee Engagement & Development Center UAA College of Business and Public Policy Professor Chad Briggs and Masters of Public Administration graduate students Maya Narang\n and Cuckoo Gupta demonstrate how they use Discord servers and board games to plan and run Arctic Strategy disaster scenarios. Living in Alaska You know it's the biggest state in the U.S., but did you know that Alaska also has some of the most varied, diverse, and gorgeous natural landscapes in the country? Between tundra, forests, rainforests, wetlands, and ocean, you're sure to find a place where adventure awaits. Check out UA's Living in Alaska page for information on what it is like living in the last frontier, and specifically the communities in which our world-class universities reside. Living in Alaska JOB ALERTS & ASSISTANCE Register your interest today! Enter your First Name (required) b9e6ad19 Enter your Last Name (required) 41e6cac2 Enter your Email Address (required) 3bdd25fa I want to learn more about the following areas of interest (required) 8c99bad1 Research Skilled Trades Financial/Accounting Marketing/Communications Student Services Information Technology Administration/Office Human Resources Register your interest! Please wait... Done Not You? Thank you Register for job alerts! Use the form below to register for job alerts.  We send out job alerts when new opportunities are posted that match the criteria you selected. Enter your First Name (required) 9ab5d165 Enter your Last Name (required) 55c865c0 Enter your Email Address (required) 63fa7ff8 Select the type of job alerts you want to receive a7ebd33d Finalize your job alert by selecting criteria from the dropdowns below. You can select multiple options from each dropdown by returning to the combobox and re-entering the list of options. Submit at the end to create your job alert. Categories Employment Type Locations Register for Job Alerts! Please wait... Done Not You? Thank you The University of Alaska (alaska.edu/alaska) is an Equal Opportunity/Equal Access Employer and Educational Institution. The University is committed to a 