ate how they use Discord servers and board games to plan and run Arctic Strategy disaster scenarios. Living in Alaska You know it's the biggest state in the U.S., but did you know that Alaska also has some of the most varied, diverse, and gorgeous natural landscapes in the country? Between tundra, forests, rainforests, wetlands, and ocean, you're sure to find a place where adventure awaits. Check out UA's Living in Alaska page for information on what it is like living in the last frontier, and specifically the communities in which our world-class universities reside. Living in Alaska JOB ALERTS & ASSISTANCE Register your interest today! Enter your First Name (required) 7e537d87 Enter your Last Name (required) 338657a0 Enter your Email Address (required) 94eb8e3d I want to learn more about the following areas of interest (required) 37c35f9d Research Skilled Trades Financial/Accounting Marketing/Communications Student Services Information Technology Administration/Office Human Resources Register your interest! Please wait... Done Not You? Thank you Register for job alerts! Use the form below to register for job alerts.  We send out job alerts when new opportunities are posted that match the criteria you selected. Enter your First Name (required) 815bd00d Enter your Last Name (required) e2bcefd8 Enter your Email Address (required) e408465a Select the type of job alerts you want to receive 5cda10b9 Finalize your job alert by selecting criteria from the dropdowns below. You can select multiple options from each dropdown by returning to the combobox and re-entering the list of options. Submit at the end to create your job alert. Categories Employment Type Locations Register for Job Alerts! Please wait... Done Not You? Thank you The University of Alaska (alaska.edu/alaska) is an Equal Opportunity/Equal Access Employer and Educational Institution. The University is committed to a policy of non-discrimination (alaska.edu/nondiscrimination) against individuals on the basis of