    "https://careers.alaska.edu/university-of-alaska-fairbanks": {
      "title": "Explore the University of Alaska Fairbanks",
      "description": "University of Alaska Fairbanks Skip to main content UA Careers Benefits Search Jobs All Jobs Staff Jobs Faculty Jobs Temporary Jobs Temporary Faculty Jobs Student Jobs Internal Jobs Universities UA Anchorage UA Fairbanks UA Southeast UA System Office Internal Jobs My Profile Kiosk mode Explore the University of Alaska Fairbanks UAF Staff UAF Faculty UAF Student UAF Temp Staff UAF Temp Faculty UA Internal Jobs Search all University of Alaska jobs Search by job title, location, department, category, etc. Search Jobs near me About the University of Alaska Fairbanks Wherever you are in your career, look north and you’ll find endless possibilities in a warm community where your resilience and commitment will be a perfect fit. At the University of Alaska Fairbanks, your work will help forge a future where the solutions to tomorrow’s big challenges are just around the corner. The University of Alaska Fairbanks is renowned for its Arctic research, Alaska Native and Indigenous programs, entrepreneurship, workforce development, and hands-on, personalized learning. UAF provides a world-class, inclusive experience — energized by innovative research, community engagement, student-centered teaching and creative expression. Life in the Arctic at UAF Video Player is loading. Play Video Play Skip Backward Skip Forward Mute Current Time 0:00 / Duration 1:00 Loaded : 1.00% 0:00 Stream Type LIVE Seek to live, currently behind live LIVE Remaining Time - 1:00 1x Playback Rate Chapters Chapters Descriptions descriptions off , selected Captions captions settings , opens captions settings dialog captions off , selected Audio Track Picture-in-Picture Fullscreen This is a modal window. Beginning of dialog window. Escape will cancel and close the window. Text Color White Black Red Green Blue Yellow Magenta Cyan Opacity Opaque Semi-Transparent Text Background Color Black White Red Green Blue Yellow Magenta Cyan Opacity Opaque Semi-Transparent Transparent Caption Area Backg