nks. Register your interest today! Enter your First Name (required) 6b692eab Enter your Last Name (required) dda30057 Enter your Email Address (required) 9c9603da I want to learn more about the following areas of interest (required) af6372d3 Research Skilled Trades Financial/Accounting Marketing/Communications Student Services Information Technology Administration/Office Human Resources Register your interest! Please wait... Done Not You? Thank you Register for job alerts! Use the form below to register for job alerts.  We send out job alerts when new opportunities are posted that match the criteria you selected. Enter your First Name (required) 053bc33f Enter your Last Name (required) d8bd32d2 Enter your Email Address (required) 59b67035 Select the type of job alerts you want to receive 9d04e6b5 Finalize your job alert by selecting criteria from the dropdowns below. You can select multiple options from each dropdown by returning to the combobox and re-entering the list of options. Submit at the end to create your job alert. Categories Employment Type Locations Register for Job Alerts! Please wait... Done Not You? Thank you Frequently Asked Questions How do I apply for a job at UA? Click our 'Search Jobs' button at the top to find your perfect role! Click 'Apply Now'! Fill out the form! Sit back & relax and we'll be in touch soon! How do I find out what jobs are available at the University of Alaska? All job postings within the University of Alaska are available 24 hours a day on our careers website . These positions are located at the three main UA Campuses, Anchorage, Fairbanks, and Juneau, as well as all the rural campus within the state. What is it like living in Alaska? We have an entire page dedicated to what life in Alaska is like. Please visit the Living in Alaska website to view some of the wonderful information we have put together for you. What benefits do you offer? Visit the UA HR Benefits website to learn more about UA's comprehensive benefit packages.