      "title": "Explore the University of Alaska Southeast",
      "description": "University of Alaska Southeast Skip to main content UA Careers Benefits Search Jobs All Jobs Staff Jobs Faculty Jobs Temporary Jobs Temporary Faculty Jobs Student Jobs Internal Jobs Universities UA Anchorage UA Fairbanks UA Southeast UA System Office Internal Jobs My Profile Kiosk mode Explore the University of Alaska Southeast UAS Staff UAS Faculty UAS Student UAS Temp Staff UAS Temp Faculty UA Internal Jobs Search all University of Alaska jobs Search by job title, location, department, category, etc. Search Jobs near me About Southeast UAS: The Heart of Alaska's Ocean Economy Experience academic excellence in Southeast Alaska on the homelands of the Tlingit, Haida, and Tsimsian peoples, where mountains meet the sea. Our small class sizes in the communities of Juneau, Ketchikan, and Sitka foster close-knit communities where every individual can thrive. Immerse yourself in Southeast’s vibrant arts scene and embrace a lifestyle centered around world-class outdoor recreation, the arts, and innovation. Discover endless opportunities for adventure, meaningful connections, and a pursuit of the good life. Join us and unlock your full potential amidst this unparalleled backdrop of natural wonder and cultural richness. UAS: Small University, Big Possibilities! Video Player is loading. Play Video Play Skip Backward Skip Forward Mute Current Time 0:00 / Duration -:- Loaded : 0% Stream Type LIVE Seek to live, currently behind live LIVE Remaining Time - 0:00 1x Playback Rate Chapters Chapters Descriptions descriptions off , selected Captions captions settings , opens captions settings dialog captions off , selected English Captions Audio Track Picture-in-Picture Fullscreen This is a modal window. Beginning of dialog window. Escape will cancel and close the window. Text Color White Black Red Green Blue Yellow Magenta Cyan Opacity Opaque Semi-Transparent Text Background Color Black White Red Green Blue Yellow Magenta Cyan Opacity Opaque Semi-Transparent Transparent Caption Area Background Color Black White Red Green Blue Yellow Magenta Cyan Opacity Transparent Semi-Transparent Opaque Font Size 50% 75% 100% 125% 150% 175% 200% 300% 400% Text Edge Style None Raised Depressed Uniform Drop shadow Font Family Proportional Sans-Serif Monospace Sans-Serif Proportional Serif Monospace Serif Casual Script Small Caps Reset Done Close Modal Dialog End of dialog window. UAS Campus Tour Video Player is loading. Play Video Play Skip Backward Skip Forward Mute Current Time 0:00 / Duration -:- Loaded : 0% Stream Type LIVE Seek to live, currently behind live LIVE Remaining Time - 0:00 1x Playback Rate Chapters Chapters Descriptions descriptions off , selected Captions captions settings , opens captions settings dialog captions off , selected English Captions Audio Track Picture-in-Picture Fullscreen This is a modal window. Beginning of dialog window. Escape will cancel and close the window. Text Color White Black Red Green Blue Yellow Magenta Cyan Opacity Opaque Semi-Transparent Text Background Color Black White Red Green Blue Yellow Magenta Cyan Opacity Opaque Semi-Transparent Transparent Caption Area Background Color Black White Red Green Blue Yellow Magenta Cyan Opacity Transparent Semi-Transparent Opaque Font Size 50% 75% 100% 125% 150% 175% 200% 300% 400% Text Edge Style None Raised Depressed Uniform Drop shadow Font Family Proportional Sans-Serif Monospace Sans-Serif Proportional Serif Monospace Serif Casual Script Small Caps Reset Done Close Modal Dialog End of dialog window. The University of Alaska Southeast is recognized as a destination of choice for students seeking excellent academic programs and engaging learning opportunities that integrate the environment and cultures of Southeast Alaska. University of Alaska Southeast University of Alaska Southeast Juneau Campus 11066 Auke Lake Way Juneau, AK 99801 (907) 796-6100 Website Ketchikan Campus Ketchikan Campus 2600 Seventh Avenue Ketchikan, AK, 99901 (907) 228-4511 Website Sitka Campus Sitka Campus 1332 Seward Ave Sitka, AK, 99835 (907) 747-7700 Website The University of Alaska Southeast (UAS) is a regional university serving all of Southeast Alaska through campuses in Juneau, Ketchikan, and Sitka. Each campus serves its own community and also contributes meaningfully to our regional university. Our foremost goal at UAS is student learning and student success. We pride ourselves on offering programs of high academic quality—both on campus and online—that meet the needs of students and the communities we serve. Our campuses reside on the unceded territories of the Áakʼw Ḵwáan, Taantʼá Ḵwáan, and Sheetkʼá Ḵwáan on Lingít Aaní, also known as Juneau, Ketchikan, and Sitka, Alaska. We acknowledge that Lingít Peoples have been stewards of the land on which we work and reside since time immemorial, and we are grateful for that stewardship and incredible care. We also recognize that our campuses are adjacent to the ancestral home of the X̱aadas and Ts’msyen and we commit to serving their peoples with equity and care. Register your interest today! Enter your First Name (required) 96169ac2 Enter your Last Name (required) 1e305c59 Enter your Email Address (required) 9feb6f3f I want to learn more about the following areas of interest (required) 4773fc4c Research Skilled Trades Financial/Accounting Marketing/Communications Student Services Information Technology Administration/Office Human Resources Register your interest! Please wait... Done Not You? Thank you Register for job alerts! Use the form below to register for job alerts.  We send out job alerts when new opportunities are posted that match the criteria you selected. Enter your First Name (required) 34605f99 Enter your Last Name (required) e929082a Enter your Email Address (required) 6d816a29 Select the type of job alerts you want to receive 71cddb7b Finalize your job alert by selecting criteria from the dropdowns below. You can select multiple options from each dropdown by returning to the combobox and re-entering the list of options. Submit at the end to create your job alert. Categories Employment Type Locations Register for Job Alerts! Please wait... Done Not You? Thank you Frequently Asked Questions How do I apply for a job at UA? Click our 'Search Jobs' button at the top to find your perfect role! Click 'Apply Now'! Fill out the form! Sit back & relax and we'll be in touch soon! How do I find out what jobs are available at the University of Alaska? All job postings within the University of Alaska are available 24 hours a day on our careers website . These positions are located at the three main UA Campuses, Anchorage, Fairbanks, and Juneau, as well as all the rural campus within the state. What is it like living in Alaska? We have an entire page dedicated to what life in Alaska is like. Please visit the Living in Alaska website to view some of the wonderful information we have put together for you. What benefits do you offer? Visit the UA HR Benefits website to learn more about UA's comprehensive benefit packages. The University of Alaska (alaska.edu/alaska) is an Equal Opportunity/Equal Access Employer and Educational Institution. The University is committed to a policy of non-discrimination (alaska.edu/nondiscrimination) against individuals on the basis of any legally protected status. This site is maintained by UA Office of Information Technology. For questions or concerns, please contact the OIT Support Center. For questions or comments regarding this page, contact helpdesk@alaska.edu | ⓒ UA Privacy Policy Candidate Details This website uses cookies. We use cookies to personalise content such as job recommendations, and to analyse our traffic. You consent to our cookies if you click \"I Accept\". If you click on \"I Do Not Accept\", then we will not use cookies but you may have a deteriorated user experience. You can change your settings by clicking on the Settings link on the top right of the device I do not accept I accept Please choose the location(s)"
